---

<Layout
  title="Sobre mí | Patricio Céspedes"
  description="Analista Programador y Licenciado en Artes. Especializado en backend, microservicios, cloud y tecnologías creativas."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-16 sm:space-y-20">
    <!-- Intro / Bio Header -->
    <header class="space-y-6">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 leading-tight"
      >
        Patricio Céspedes
      </h1>

      <div
        class="space-y-4 text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed"
      >
        <p>
          Soy estudiante de cuarto semestre de Analista Programador, con interés
          en desarrollo backend y tecnologías cloud. Me motiva diseñar
          soluciones escalables, aprender nuevas tecnologías y fortalecer
          continuamente mis habilidades en desarrollo de software.
        </p>
        <p>
          Antes de iniciar mi formación en informática, desarrollé una
          trayectoria en el ámbito artístico, liderando proyectos
          interdisciplinarios y ejerciendo docencia musical. Esta experiencia
          fortaleció mis competencias en gestión de proyectos, trabajo
          colaborativo y resolución creativa de problemas.
        </p>
        <p>
          Actualmente busco integrarme a un equipo donde pueda desarrollarme
          profesionalmente, aportando una perspectiva técnico-creativa en el
          desarrollo de productos y soluciones tecnológicas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/patricioisaias"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 text-white dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path
              d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          Conectar en LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/patricioisaias"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 hover:bg-neutral-50 dark:hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              clip-rule="evenodd"
              d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Stack Tecnológico -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Stack tecnológico
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {
          stack.map((group) => (
            <div class="p-5 border border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 bg-neutral-50/40 dark:bg-neutral-900/30 space-y-3">
              <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
                {group.category}
              </h3>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
                {group.skills.map((skill) => (
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-600 select-none" />
                    <span>{skill}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experiencia -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Experiencia
      </h2>

      <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200/60 dark:divide-neutral-800/60">
        {
          experience.map((item) => (
            <div class="py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1 sm:gap-4">
              <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
                {item.company}{" "}
                <span class="text-neutral-400 font-normal">—</span>{" "}
                <span class="font-normal text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
                  {item.role}
                </span>
              </h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500 whitespace-nowrap">
                {item.period}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Formación -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Formación
      </h2>

      <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200/60 dark:divide-neutral-800/60">
        {
          education.map((item) => (
            <div class="py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1 sm:gap-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
                  {item.institution}
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
                  {item.degree}
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500 whitespace-nowrap">
                {item.period}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reconocimientos -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Reconocimientos
      </h2>

      <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200/60 dark:divide-neutral-800/60">
        {
          awards.map((item) => (
            <div class="py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1 sm:gap-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
                  {item.title}
                </h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
                  {item.institution}
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500 whitespace-nowrap">
                {item.year}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Idiomas -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Idiomas
      </h2>

      <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200/60 dark:divide-neutral-800/60">
        {
          languages.map((item) => (
            <div class="py-3.5 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
                {item.name}
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
                {item.level}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Playlist de Spotify -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 pb-3"
      >
        Mi playlist
      </h2>

      <div
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-neutral-800/70 bg-neutral-50/40 dark:bg-neutral-900/30"
      >
        <iframe
          data-testid="embed-iframe"
          style="border-radius:1px"
          src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/08U3jDJnjzT7JKilX4TGr8?utm_source=generator&theme=0&si=a8f520cb962f45bc"
          width="100%"
          height="600"
          allowfullscreen=""
          allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
          loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Proyectos seleccionados (Desplegable) -->
    <section>
      <details
        class="group border border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-neutral-800/70 bg-neutral-50/40 dark:bg-neutral-900/30 p-5 sm:p-6 transition-colors"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer select-none list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h2
              class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>Proyectos seleccionados</span>
              <span
                class="text-xs font-mono font-normal text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 px-2 py-0.5 border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800"
              >
                2013 – 2026
              </span>
            </h2>
            <p
              class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
            >
              Haz clic para desplegar la cronología completa de proyectos y
              obras.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-2 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-950 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </summary>

        <div
          class="pt-8 space-y-8 border-t border-neutral-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/60 mt-6"
        >
          {
            selectedProjects.map((group) => (
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-100/80 dark:bg-neutral-900">
                    {group.year}
                  </span>
                  <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-neutral-200/40 dark:bg-neutral-800/40" />
                </div>

                <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm pl-1">
                  {group.items.map((item) => (
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2 py-1 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
                      <span class="text-neutral-400 mt-1 select-none text-xs">
                        •
                      </span>
                      <div>
                        <span class="font-medium text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50">
                          {item.name}
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
                          {" "}
                          — {item.desc}
                        </span>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
